{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbExciting Skeleton World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast Skeleton World\u2500\u2500Explore the ever-changing open scenes and encounter different types of skeleton enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the joy of exploring new discoveries and the sense of accomplishment when conquering powerful enemies. Rich content is waiting for you to experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCollect weapons and equipment from defeated enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you defeat an enemy, you can gain the enemy's soul power, and it is more likely to drop the enemy's weapons and equipment\u2500\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a weapon that suits you, wear stronger equipment to challenge stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbGroup drama in the Skeleton World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the cold and broken Skeleton World, fragmented but colorful stories are staged one by one.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3901780?t=1754659580","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901780/1e2c352cc09df9f73205c221d4ab8a8a8c11c8c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754659580","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901780/405a8d57d7b30058aaec736077df0e473f818a07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754659580","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901780/405a8d57d7b30058aaec736077df0e473f818a07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754659580","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbExciting Skeleton World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast Skeleton World\u2500\u2500Explore the ever-changing open scenes and encounter different types of skeleton enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the joy of exploring new discoveries and the sense of accomplishment when conquering powerful enemies. Rich content is waiting for you to experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCollect weapons and equipment from defeated enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you defeat an enemy, you can gain the enemy's soul power, and it is more likely to drop the enemy's weapons and equipment\u2500\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a weapon that suits you, wear stronger equipment to challenge stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbGroup drama in the Skeleton World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the cold and broken Skeleton World, fragmented but colorful stories are staged one by one.</p>","developers":["\u51e0\u51e0\u4e0d\u5c0f\u5fc3"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901780/57b18ce2c9082b5531f90d9be960048b2ead785d/header.jpg?t=1754659580","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3901780/1806671254/7d9b96f2d7524aa43da8589eedf3ef240013e3df/1754144102/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754148061","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3901780/1806671254/7d9b96f2d7524aa43da8589eedf3ef240013e3df/1754144102/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754148061","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3901780/1806671254/7d9b96f2d7524aa43da8589eedf3ef240013e3df/1754144102/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754148061